{"about_the_game":"Killer Dog is an action platformer with nice pixel-art graphics.<br>Hector is an ordinary dog who just wants to get back home, but things keep going wrong. Help him overcome all difficulties and save his friends!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a number of diverse levels, finding secrets and collecting treasures!<br></li><li> Fight various enemies: from some simple thugs to savage creatures of Hell and cunning aliens!<br></li><li> Avoid tricky traps!<br></li><li> Find delicious food across platforms, that will help you to recover lost health.<br></li><li> Spend the points you have collected to buy some upgrades, which will greatly improve the skills of your dog.<br></li><li> Even a good dog can not fight without friends! In some levels other characters will help you on your mission.<br></li><li> At the end of each chapter a tough boss will await you. Defeating him will require skill and elaborate tactics.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1359170?t=1594916739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1594916739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1594916739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1594916739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains a moderate amount of cartoonish violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Killer Dog is an action platformer with nice pixel-art graphics.<br>Hector is an ordinary dog who just wants to get back home, but things keep going wrong. Help him overcome all difficulties and save his friends!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a number of diver